+The hub declares its tiers in `gate.yaml`, numbered `tier0` through `tier3`, and `lyx gate test --tier <n>` runs one.
+
 | Tier | Tag | Needs | Costs |
 |---|---|---|---|
-| 1 | none | nothing: offline, no spawn | seconds, runs on every `go test ./...` |
